{"id":"precisamente","lemma":"precisamente","pos":"adv","rank":1643,"glosses":["precisely"],"ipa":"/pɾeˌθisaˈmente/","order":1693,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-precisamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Precisamente lo tengo aquí.","en":"I happen to have it right here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300102","words":[null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Eso es precisamente lo que yo quería.","en":"That's just what I wanted.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537969","words":[null,null,null,null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"],[3,5,"what, that which"]]},{"text":"Precisamente él es el hombre que buscamos.","en":"He is precisely the man we're looking for.","words":[null,{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to seek","l":"buscar"}]}]}